    "code": "# jaryan: manba-e voltazh-e ghabel-e tanzim-e azmayeshgah.\n# har gam-e slider 0.1 volt ast; duty * 3.3 / 1023 = tenths / 10 volt.\nfrom machine import Pin, ADC, PWM\nimport time\n\nknob = ADC(Pin(34))\nknob.atten(ADC.ATTN_11DB)\nsupply = PWM(Pin(14), freq=1000)\n\ntenths = round(knob.read() * 33 / 4095)\nsupply.duty(tenths * 31)\n\nwhile True:\n    time.sleep(0.2)\n",
